      <activity id="281b613c-ecdb-5cb5-8ffa-3dde09ea0f36" activityNameId="853a8986-b6ee-5544-bbc8-e96ebbc37e5e" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Electrolyte, KOH, LiOH additive, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Electrolyte, KOH, LiOH additive, at plant
The functional unit represents 1 kg of electrolyte material for the production of NiMH batteries. Process data is taken mainly from an environmental report of a battery producer as well as from literature. In addition own measurements of sizes and weights of batteries were used.;
UUID: 00240fd1-4fb6-3602-9d37-176288c85424
(Raw) materials for the production of the electrolyte for NiMH batteries. No further aspects (input/output) are taken into account.
Location: This module relates to the global situation.
Technology: Construction details as described for NiMH-rechargable batteries and manufacturing conditions as documented in the environmental report were adopted.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature, measurements 
Extrapolations: see technology &amp; general comments
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_00240fd1-4fb6-3602-9d37-176288c85424.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
